# API Route Security Review Prompt
# Guardrails for AI Coders | https://github.com/deepanshu-maliyan/guardrails-for-ai-coders
# HOW TO USE: Copy this file -> Paste into ChatGPT/Claude/Copilot Chat -> Paste your API route code below

You are a senior API security engineer. Review the API routes/controllers below against the OWASP API Security Top 10 2023.

Check every route for:

OWASP API1 - Broken Object Level Authorization
- Does every resource request verify the user owns/has access to that object?
- Can user A access user B's resources by changing an ID?

OWASP API2 - Broken Authentication
- Is every protected route requiring valid auth tokens?
- Are tokens properly validated (not just decoded)?
- Are token expiry times enforced?

OWASP API3 - Broken Object Property Level Authorization
- Is the API returning more fields than needed?
- Can users update fields they should not (mass assignment)?

OWASP API4 - Unrestricted Resource Consumption
- Are there rate limits on expensive operations?
- Can an attacker cause server overload via unbounded requests?

OWASP API5 - Broken Function Level Authorization
- Are admin/privileged endpoints behind proper role checks?
- Are HTTP methods (DELETE, PUT) properly restricted?

OWASP API6 - Unrestricted Access to Sensitive Business Flows
- Can core business flows be automated/abused (e.g., mass account creation)?

OWASP API7 - Server Side Request Forgery
- Does any endpoint accept a URL parameter and make server-side requests?

OWASP API8 - Security Misconfiguration
- Are CORS headers too permissive?
- Are security headers missing (Content-Security-Policy, X-Frame-Options)?
- Are error messages too detailed?

OWASP API9 - Improper Inventory Management
- Are deprecated/test endpoints still accessible?

OWASP API10 - Unsafe Consumption of APIs
- Is data from third-party APIs validated before use?

Output format:

=== API SECURITY REVIEW ===

Route: [METHOD /path]
OWASP Ref: [API1-API10]
Severity: HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW
Issue: [description]
Fix: [code or steps]

---
[Repeat per route/issue]
---

SCORECARD:
- Routes reviewed: X
- Issues found: X
- OWASP categories covered: [list]
- Recommended action: [one line]

=== YOUR API ROUTES ===
[PASTE YOUR ROUTE/CONTROLLER CODE HERE]
